  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "漫画『ULTRAMAN』より「ULTRAMAN SUIT Ver7.5」がFigure-rise Standardに登場！",
      "en": "\"ULTRAMAN SUIT Ver7.5 \" from the manga \" ULTRAMAN\" is now available in Figure-rise Standard!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 本体表面の銀色はエクストラフィニッシュ、赤色はグロスインジェクションで質感を再現。",
      "en": "• The silver color on the main body surface is extra finish, and the red color is gloss injection to reproduce the texture."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 専用のLEDユニットが付属し、目を光らせることが可能。",
      "en": "• A dedicated LED unit is included, allowing you to keep an eye on it."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 「ULTRAMAN SUIT Ver7.5」の主要武装のほか、原作者・清水栄一氏デザインの「EYE SLUGGER」がオリジナル武器パーツとして付属。",
      "en": "• In addition to the main weapons of \"ULTRAMAN SUIT Ver7.5 \", \" EYE SLUGGER\" designed by the original author Eiichi Shimizu is included as an original weapon part."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 「EYE SLUGGER」は両手に携行することが可能。",
      "en": "• \"EYE SLUGGER\" can be carried in both hands."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• ２つの「EYE SLUGGER」を合体させることができるジョイントパーツが付属。",
      "en": "• Comes with joint parts that can combine two \"EYE SLUGGER\"."
    }
  ],
